    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tycoon Land: Figurine Shop</i> is a first-person management simulation where every detail of running a collectible figure store comes to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your shop to optimize both flow and fandom. Organize shelves, set up themed display tables, and create the ultimate experience for collectors who step through your doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your in-game computer to order new stock, unpack mystery boxes, and store rare figurines. Hand-paint your figures to increase their value, and arrange them strategically to attract curious buyers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your checkout like a pro\u2014scan figures, process sales, and make sure each customer leaves with both a great purchase and a great memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the economics of the collectible market. Adjust prices based on rarity, market demand, and how well your store is decorated to keep clients browsing longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your profits grow, reinvest in your business. Expand your shop, unlock new licenses, host miniature battle tournaments, and become the talk of the figurine community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Tycoon Land: Figurine Shop</i>, every decision matters. Will you rise from a small corner shop to a legendary destination for collectors and fans?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702020/extras/435a7346fc213802cd318355b1719211.poster.avif?t=1750161143\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702020/extras/435a7346fc213802cd318355b1719211.webm?t=1750161143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702020/extras/435a7346fc213802cd318355b1719211.mp4?t=1750161143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tycoon Land: Figurine Shop</i> is a first-person management simulation where every detail of running a collectible figure store comes to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your shop to optimize both flow and fandom. Organize shelves, set up themed display tables, and create the ultimate experience for collectors who step through your doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your in-game computer to order new stock, unpack mystery boxes, and store rare figurines. Hand-paint your figures to increase their value, and arrange them strategically to attract curious buyers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your checkout like a pro\u2014scan figures, process sales, and make sure each customer leaves with both a great purchase and a great memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the economics of the collectible market. Adjust prices based on rarity, market demand, and how well your store is decorated to keep clients browsing longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your profits grow, reinvest in your business. Expand your shop, unlock new licenses, host miniature battle tournaments, and become the talk of the figurine community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Tycoon Land: Figurine Shop</i>, every decision matters. Will you rise from a small corner shop to a legendary destination for collectors and fans?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702020/extras/435a7346fc213802cd318355b1719211.poster.avif?t=1750161143\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702020/extras/435a7346fc213802cd318355b1719211.webm?t=1750161143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702020/extras/435a7346fc213802cd318355b1719211.mp4?t=1750161143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
